msgid "AT serial port"
msgstr "AT port srathach"

msgid "Detected USB/ACM serial ports. For Quectel EC200A use /dev/ttyUSB2; /dev/ttyUSB0 is the diagnostic port and does not answer AT commands."
msgstr "Na calafoirt sraitheacha USB/ACM braite. Le haghaidh Quectel EC200A úsáid /dev/ttyUSB2; Is é /dev/ttyUSB0 an calafort diagnóiseach agus ní fhreagraíonn sé orduithe AT."

