msgid "This service reboots only the modem, not the router. If the modem is the only WAN, internet and remote access will be down during the reboot. Do not change USB mode, APN or band settings remotely without a rollback plan."
msgstr "Ní atosaíonn an tseirbhís seo ach an móideim, ní an ródaire. Más é an móideim an t-aon WAN, beidh rochtain idirlín agus cianda síos le linn an atosaigh. Ná athraigh socruithe mód USB, APN nó banna go cianda gan plean ais-rollta."

